%% Customer catalog, cart, and checkout journey
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Customer
    participant Web as Customer Web/BFF
    participant Catalog as Catalog API
    participant Cart as Cart API
    participant Checkout as Checkout API
    participant DB as Tenant PostgreSQL
    participant Payment as Payment adapter

    Customer->>Web: Open tenant storefront
    Web->>Catalog: GET published catalog and product detail
    Catalog->>DB: Read published products, variants, inventory
    DB-->>Catalog: Tenant-scoped catalog projection
    Catalog-->>Web: Tenant-scoped catalog projection

    Customer->>Web: Add variant to cart
    Web->>Cart: POST cart/items with x-cart-token
    Cart->>DB: Validate publication, variant, price, and stock
    DB-->>Cart: Updated guest cart
    Cart-->>Web: Cart token and current totals

    opt Customer signs in
        Web->>Cart: POST cart/merge with guest token
        Cart->>DB: Merge guest items into customer cart
        Cart->>DB: Revalidate ownership and availability
        DB-->>Cart: Account cart result
        Cart-->>Web: Account cart result
    end

    Customer->>Web: Start checkout
    Web->>Checkout: POST checkout/preview
    Checkout->>DB: Re-read prices, stock, delivery, discount, and policy
    DB-->>Checkout: Persisted server-priced draft
    Checkout-->>Web: Authoritative totals and payment options

    alt COD
        Web->>Checkout: POST checkout/orders + idempotency key
        Checkout->>DB: Transactionally create order and reserve inventory
        DB-->>Checkout: COD order reference
        Checkout-->>Web: COD order reference
    else Prepaid
        Web->>Checkout: Create prepaid order/payment attempt
        Checkout->>DB: Persist order and payment attempt
        Checkout->>Payment: Create hosted session
        Payment-->>Web: Redirect/session
        Payment->>Checkout: Signed callback
        Checkout->>DB: Verify and finalize payment state
        DB-->>Checkout: Updated order/payment status
        Checkout-->>Web: Updated order/payment status
    end

    Note over Cart,DB: Cart contents are not checkout truth; mutable facts are revalidated.
    Note over Checkout,DB: Browser retries are deduplicated by idempotency key.
